The reasons for running this crystal structure in extended mode are given in the "reasons" directory.  The fort.21 in this case has an atom that is not included in 
the molecule, as it is too many unit cells from the centre of mass of the molecule.

To run NEIGHCRYS, type
   cp NEIGHCRYS_input/* .
   neighcrys.out < neighcrys_answers

To run DMACRYS, type
   dmacrys.out < BTXXIII_16.dmain > BTXXIII_16.dmaout
